sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 开发者 / Agent 内核
    participant Client as ZhipuGLMClient
    participant Zhipu as 智谱 BigModel 网关 (OpenAI 兼容)
    participant Ark as 火山方舟网关 (OpenAI 兼容)
    participant Model as GLM-5.3-Flash / DeepSeek-V4-Flash

    User->>Client: 发送请求 chat(messages, stream=True)
    Client->>Zhipu: HTTP POST /chat/completions (Bearer ZHIPU_API_KEY)
    Zhipu->>Model: 提交 System/User 上下文与 Tools 定义
    Model-->>Zhipu: 实时流式吐出 Token 碎片
    Zhipu-->>Client: SSE 数据流分块 (Chunks)
    Note over Client: 实时捕获文本增量并支持实时回调
    Client-->>User: 逐字回调 / 流式渲染到终端
    Note over Client,Zhipu: 若智谱网关超时 / 异常
    Client->>Ark: 自动降级 POST /chat/completions (Bearer ARK_API_KEY)
    Ark-->>Client: DeepSeek-V4-Flash 流式响应接管
    Client-->>User: 灾备引擎接管，任务不中断
